/**
 * GrowLine pilot · registration receiver (Google Apps Script web app)
 *
 * Paste this into Extensions → Apps Script of the Google Sheet that should
 * hold the data, then deploy it as a web app (see SETUP.md next to this file).
 *
 * Each registration writes:
 *   - one row to the "Registrations" tab (one per farmer), and
 *   - one row per farm to the "Farms" tab, linked by registration_id.
 *
 * The page sends JSON as text/plain on purpose: Apps Script cannot answer a
 * CORS preflight, and text/plain keeps the browser from sending one.
 */

